  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391310
    - rid: 268100066478391311
    - rid: 268100066478391312
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uhh... my feet are killing me...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391313
    - rid: 268100066478391315
    - rid: 268100094052532224
    - rid: 268100094052532225
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Is this where the coven is hiding?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532226
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Should be, the old man's journey said it was a cave down in Falkreath,
      with surroundings exactly like this one.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: You think that these witches will have some sort of tricks up their sleeves?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Undoubtedly, if they have the power to curse our very blood, who can
      say what else they can do.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (We're probably in over our heads, aren't we...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532228
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Bah! Even so, they won't be able to match our strength united.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532231
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Strength this, strength that, I won't do you much good if they magically
      turn your pants solid.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532232
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait, crap, <i>can</i> they do that-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532233
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe. Only one way to find out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532234
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The four enter the cave.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532235
    - rid: 268100094052532236
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
